Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）人们称我为——No.猎人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.43,0:00:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）不可能……除了我以外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然还有人在收集
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）No.卡不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的记忆吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那为什么别人会……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.35,0:00:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不明白……一切都是谜。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，别大意。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方可不是普通人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.01,0:00:22.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天！我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.81,0:00:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽竟然有2只！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.17,0:00:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且仅仅在1个回合之间就召唤出来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《No.猎人……这个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.10,0:00:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究竟出于什么目的收集 No.卡……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.46,0:00:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且他完全没有被 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.48,0:00:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}附身的气息》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）轮到你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快点打！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我闭嘴。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵、遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:01:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆石人！好，如果是隆隆隆石人的话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.63,0:01:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能扛住两次攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怪兽以里侧守备表示盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.90,0:01:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.51,0:01:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！我的回合！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动白辉士 启明者的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将一张手牌送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.54,0:01:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽一张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……再发动巨岩辉煌的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.46,0:01:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取除一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让这只怪兽的攻击力提升300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！巨岩辉煌！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.72,0:01:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是那边比较高，但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.34,0:01:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨强魔像在1回合只有一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被战斗破坏的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦，稍微有点手感嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.59,0:02:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我还有另一只怪兽的攻击留着呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！白辉士 光耀者！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，我的怪兽就全灭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.60,0:02:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，他的场地上也已经
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.60,0:02:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有能攻击的怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.48,0:02:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对啊！得救了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了？哼！差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也该让我拿出真本事了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:32.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？这家伙，你是说他还
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.17,0:02:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没拿出真本事吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.09,0:02:35.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将巨强辉耀与
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}白辉士 光耀者解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易召唤出来的 No.怪兽居然要解放掉吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？那家伙…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.50,0:02:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光之化身 现在降临！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.64,0:03:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么！？那玩意！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！银河眼的光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的光子龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法通常召唤{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要将攻击力２０００以上的怪兽２只
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.17,0:05:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}解放 来特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.17,0:05:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力３０００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:11.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子龙什么的听都没听说过啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《那家伙是…》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样 我的回合就结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力３０００能扛住这次攻击的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.47,0:05:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的卡组里 只有霍普啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 要想召唤霍普需要２只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是叫不出来的话 可就真不妙了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.39,0:05:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我魔术师）嘎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来才是胜负关键！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡怪兽槽！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 将等级４的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同等级的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.11,0:05:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从卡组抽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那张卡是同样的等级４
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就将那只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 等级４。　这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就赌在这次抽卡上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.93,0:06:10.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我抽到的卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4的坚忍骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.53,0:06:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（硬币掉落的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，坚忍骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:24.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（坚忍骑士）坚忍～。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.14,0:06:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我的场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就有2只等级4的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.67,0:06:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}坚忍骑士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39。希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（霍普）霍～普。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.46,0:07:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了，霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗，No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（心园）您意下如何
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}菲卡博士大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（菲卡）世界决斗狂欢节？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.23,0:07:11.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。在这心园
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由拥有炽热斗志的决斗者们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.94,0:07:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}举办一场盛大的决斗大会。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.14,0:07:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来自世界各地拥有 No.卡的决斗者们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会大批聚集而来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.53,0:07:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让快斗也参加那场比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要快斗夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝大多数 No.卡就会落入我们手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对你来说，这倒是个好主意。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，如果快斗在那场大会上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}万一败北的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必担心。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗的卡组{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:50.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是由我们和菲卡博士大人共同打造的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异世界科学的结晶。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.99,0:07:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧，心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我允许举办世界决斗狂欢节。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵。那么，就顺便用这个球形力场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行实验吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有这个球形力场把 No.们的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更多地引出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用那股能量的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）哈啊 哈啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（惨叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再让我多听听。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.10,0:08:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再多 再多。 再多！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:09:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了 哈鲁特。 就用你的绝叫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把星光体世界击溃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的攻击力是３０００
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的攻击力是２５００。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:13.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这里我要攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在和鲨鱼的战斗中 就算是霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也并非无敌这件事我是明白的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击才是最大的防御。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。 那个战术不坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.58,0:09:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以你自己的方式似乎成长了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.11,0:09:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，跟这个对手打持久战可不妙。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里就一口气上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡 破天荒之风。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡让我场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只的攻击力和守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.93,0:09:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到下一个自己的回合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来就超过那家伙的怪兽的攻击力了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦？要向银河眼挑战吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让它见识见识你的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.92,0:10:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊 好不容易召唤出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赶紧给我滚去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说的是你的怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.05,0:10:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别小看银河眼的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼的效果 发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.78,0:10:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这只怪兽进行战斗的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从游戏中除外。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来你的战斗就不成立了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 你怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 我 就这样结束战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:40.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个瞬间 银河眼的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 因银河眼的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:44.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从游戏中除外的怪兽们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗结束时会重新回到场上。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:49.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来不是被干掉了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要霍普回来就能躲过那家伙的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.50,0:11:01.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼真正的力量从现在才开始。啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼将除外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是怪兽超量的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.93,0:11:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收那个超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1个单位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的超量单位！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从你这家伙的 No.卡中吸收的单位有2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来银河眼的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升1000点！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}4000的话就是我的全部生命值啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人 请把那家伙的灵魂也一起给抽出来吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.73,0:11:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灵魂？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说起来 那时候的犯人……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.45,0:11:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 简直就像是被抽走了灵魂一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.15,0:11:48.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 多嘴了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.01,0:11:51.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对要打倒的对手居然故意植入恐惧心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是卑鄙至极！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻～！遵命！遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这到底是怎么回事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}半吊子的恐惧心也让人不舒服。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我来告诉你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.83,0:12:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我获得 No.卡的方法稍微有点强硬{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:10.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我得到 No.卡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙的灵魂也会从肉体中脱离。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.61,0:12:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那灵魂会去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事不在我的管辖范围内。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.19,0:12:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这场决斗中连游马的灵魂都……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.86,0:12:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼……我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼，攻击那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.只能由 No.来打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.56,0:12:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是伤害你就给我受着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上，速攻魔法光子风，发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是在自己回合的战斗中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然给予了对方战斗伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.37,0:13:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但没能破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予1000点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.49,0:13:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连 No.无法被破坏这件事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.61,0:13:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都算到了吗！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.31,0:13:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且我还能凭借光子风的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖1张卡，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……哈！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.14,0:13:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我自己的生命值好像也被削掉了相当多。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别站起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么投降，认输吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样的话就不用尝到多余的痛苦了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.13,0:13:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那份斗志我倒是赞赏。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但你会后悔的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能因为这种程度就放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:14:01.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就如你所愿让我来猎取你的灵魂吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.95,0:14:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.77,0:14:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这帮家伙强得离谱！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用一飞冲天召唤出来的霍普也
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.54,0:14:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然完全不是对手{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办… 该怎么办！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.48,0:14:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.只能靠 No.来打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的怪兽不是 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用这一点把霍普变成守备表示的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的攻击暂时就能防住！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个男人甚至舍弃了 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤出了银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你觉得他没料到 No.会变成守备表示吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 但是 该怎么办…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说过攻击是最好的防御。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.72,0:14:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯彻这一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.02,0:15:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}话是这么说没错{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己要是输了这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会消失的吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.07,0:15:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。这次我和你条件相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就不怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.01,0:15:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，我已经无法退缩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的宿命。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这家伙居然面不改色……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一直都进行着
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:24.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种赌上性命的决斗吗……》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，克服恐惧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦露出破绽就赢不了这个对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星光体！唯独这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要和你合力一战！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，一飞冲天！我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤兹巴巴骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（兹巴巴骑士）兹巴～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡，复制骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复制骑士在自己场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的战士族怪兽被召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.48,0:16:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成与那张卡相同的等级和卡名
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级3的刷啦啦骑士和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复制骑士进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.75,0:16:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.17！ 修正龙！！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}姆啾～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.77,0:16:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No. No. No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.55,0:16:52.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认到第2只 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.82,0:16:54.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第2只 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:58.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 你这家伙也是 No.猎人吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}省了不少多余的功夫，正好。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的 No.我就全部收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动修正龙的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正龙1回合1次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.69,0:17:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这样的话 可及不上我的银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的攻击力啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的目标 可不在于此！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 交叉攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.60,0:17:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同的2只怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为放弃1只攻击的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的1只可以直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的霍普和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}修正龙的攻击力 都是相同的2500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 只要能削掉那个男人的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的走向 还尚未可知。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 希望皇霍普 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到还挺有策略的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 斩击！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.46,0:18:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与赢不了的对手的战斗就回避吗。 但是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 光子化！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.90,0:18:10.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上有光属性怪兽存在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手发起战斗时
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使那只怪兽1体的攻击无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己光属性怪兽1体的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升那只怪兽攻击力的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这…攻击力 6500！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.59,0:18:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是挨了那家伙的攻击…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.45,0:18:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行 赢不了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.01,0:18:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在预料之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}预料之中？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听好了 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转的机会 只有一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逆转 那种事…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你手牌里的陷阱盖下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的陷阱…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我手上有的神圣铠甲 镜甲。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 镜甲是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方 进行战斗时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为攻击对象的自己怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以提升到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙的怪兽相同的攻击力。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:04.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算攻击力相同{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.83,0:19:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.怪兽也只能用 No.怪兽来打倒。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.19,0:19:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说就算那家伙的银河升阶被消灭{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的霍普也能活下来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 你的逆转一手吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.85,0:19:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.45,0:19:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我盖一张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.37,0:19:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 哈鲁特！再多来点～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:44.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.71,0:19:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来吧！》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.45,0:19:54.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《来吧》
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤光子·地狱犬。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡被召唤的回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡无法发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.23,0:20:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.20,0:20:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，镜面护甲就无法发动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？你以为我会不警惕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.99,0:20:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的盖牌{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就贸然攻击吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.35,0:20:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……这个男人的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然在我之上吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.39,0:20:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你的灵魂一起，让我狩猎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.27,0:20:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！银河眼·光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束了……到此为止……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（呻吟声）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（春人）哥哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子龙…… 啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.60,0:21:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗就先交给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:13.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的名字叫 快斗！ 给我刻在脑子里！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.76,0:21:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧 轨道7！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.76,0:21:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）到底怎么回事？ 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}完全束手无策。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.85,0:21:47.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么一飞冲天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么决斗冠军啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这样怎么可能当得上决斗冠军啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哭喊声）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:15.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗 开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.05,0:22:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）本周的问题。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法 陷阱卡是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.21,0:22:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最多可以盖放几张？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}5张？还是6张？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.81,0:24:14.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}答案是6张！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法陷阱卡在这个区域放5张。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且只有场地魔法卡可以在这里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:23.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖放哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.59,0:24:24.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别搞错了。

